    "id": "gateway-port",
    "title": "启动时连接了旧端口",
    "scene": "boot",
    "question": "启动 Agent 时网关连接 db.local:5433 被拒绝。注册中心已经切到 5432，请修正连接参数选择并保留未注册时的回退。",
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/gateway.ts",
        "content": "export function selectPort(configured: number, registered: number | null) {\n  return configured || registered\n}\n"
      }
    ],
    "checks": [
      {
        "name": "复现反馈",
        "file": "src/gateway.ts",
        "fn": "selectPort",
        "args": [5433, 5432],
        "expected": 5432
      },
      {
        "name": "保留正常行为",
        "file": "src/gateway.ts",
        "fn": "selectPort",
        "args": [6543, null],
        "expected": 6543
      },
      {
        "name": "边界输入",
        "file": "src/gateway.ts",
        "fn": "selectPort",
        "args": [6432, 7432],
        "expected": 7432
      }
    ],
    "demoEdits": [
      {
        "path": "src/gateway.ts",
        "before": "configured || registered",
        "after": "registered ?? configured"
      }
    ],
    "expected": "published",
    "method": "比较每个输入在修改前后的实际返回值。全部通过后下载修复版本，回滚后核对原始源码。"
  },
