    "scene": "agent",
    "question": "我觉得 Agent 不好用：同时调用 read_state 和 list_jobs，后者先完成时 tool_call_id 被写成前者的，下一轮关联失败。请修复结果封装。",
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/dispatch.ts",
        "content": "import { toolMessage } from './message.js'\n\nexport function collect(pending: string[], completed: {id: string, value: string}[]) {\n  return completed.map((event, index) => toolMessage(pending[index], event.value))\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "path": "src/message.ts",
        "content": "export function toolMessage(id: string, content: string) {\n  return { role: 'tool', tool_call_id: id, content }\n}\n"
      }
    ],
    "checks": [
      {
        "name": "逆序完成",
        "file": "src/dispatch.ts",
